@*
    Overrides the embedded Identity UI partial so scripts load from ~/lib/... (LibMan) instead of
    ~/Identity/lib/... . The package paths interact poorly with MapStaticAssets in Linux containers
    even when files exist on disk; standard wwwroot/lib URLs match Kinnect-style setups.
*@
<script src="~/lib/jquery/dist/jquery.min.js"></script>
<script src="~/lib/jquery-validation/dist/jquery.validate.min.js"></script>
<script src="~/lib/jquery-validation-unobtrusive/dist/jquery.validate.unobtrusive.min.js"></script>
